{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55256","headline":"平日自咏（题拟） · 冯道","name":"平日自咏（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公事之余喜坐禅，少曾将胁到牀眠。\n虽然现出宰官相，长老之名天下传。\n（见宋金盈之八卷本《醉翁谈录》卷六。\n）（〖1〗《醉翁谈录》：「近代冯相於中书退朝之暇，未始不以坐禅爲念。\n故天下万口一词，遂以冯长老之名归之，况冯相平日自有诗曰〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}